<h2>The case in one view</h2>
<table class="law">
  <tr><th>Case</th><td>Asian Satellite Broadcast Pvt. Ltd. & Anr. v. Religare Finvest Ltd. & Anr., O.M.P. (COMM) 253/2026 with connected cross-petitions</td></tr>
